	)
	(text "SAFE_3V3 supply (U16)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 267.97 196.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b0349f7d-4a12-579e-bded-da54034e40ea")
	)
	(text "Notes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7018b067-accc-51b8-bed3-fc8f9ca78379")
	)
	(text "1. Host request: MOTOR_EN (arming sequence), HOST_HEARTBEAT, SERVO_REQUEST and the PWM lines\n   MOTOR_RP/RN/LP/LN reach U12 only through buffer U29.\n2. MCU permit: U12 raises MCU_MOTOR_PERMIT or MCU_SERVO_PERMIT only after a valid arming\n   sequence with a live heartbeat, and services watchdog U13 only while its own checks pass."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cca035e1-ca9c-5ed2-a763-b12a435df09e")
	)
	(text "3. Hardware gates: U14 drives MOTOR_EN_SAFE (motor driver nSLEEP), U27 drives SERVO_POWER_EN\n   (switch U15). Each is HIGH only while MOTOR_EN, its permit and MOTOR_FAULT are HIGH.\n4. Fault bus: MOTOR_FAULT is open drain, LOW = fault, driven by U11, U30, U13 and U15. LOW turns\n   both gates off and resets U12; actuators stay off until the host arms again."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4ba710d0-86c3-5488-ab4d-e657f414c097")
	)
	(text "5. Programming: SW5 in PROG disables U13 and clamps both permits LOW while U12 is halted.\n6. No actuator permission survives a reset, a watchdog timeout or a recognized fault.\n7. Safety MCU firmware: firmware/safety-mcu.\n8. Motor driver U1 and supervisor U11: sheet 3 (Motor isolation and current limits).\n9. Sensor switch U30: sheet 7 (Protected external signals)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 276.86 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9d5e7637-df87-5ec5-99dc-3c866b9fb28a")
	)
	(text "U29: 5.5 V-tolerant inputs with Ioff,\nOE1/OE2 tied LOW.\nRN9, R45, R47 and RN6 (pin 2) hold\nthe host lines LOW while the host is\nabsent or booting."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "582077ec-eaa5-5b6e-97f0-eb63770df750")
	)
	(text "U28 runs from PI_3V3, so the host pins cannot back-power the safety domain.\nHOST_FAULT_BUFFER HIGH = healthy (READY); it reaches HOST_FAULT through R20 on sheet 3 (Motor isolation and current limits).\nHOST_ARMED HIGH = motor enabled (MOTOR_EN_SAFE)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "289992f1-b54b-5b8d-8568-6871792a2bef")
	)
	(text "R48, R49: read-back through 10 kΩ;\na bridged MCU pin cannot hold an\nenable HIGH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 176.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "329ce417-6894-5561-b55f-d737942f89d4")
	)
	(text "MOTOR_FAULT LOW resets\nU12 through R31\n(R30 47 kΩ, C29 1 nF)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 179.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9761fc2d-1b1d-5c15-839b-b387d2ef599d")
	)
	(text "PROG_N LOW clamps\nboth permits to\nabout 0.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "232415f6-00d1-5db0-bdc0-d9ef8ae6ccb2")
	)
	(text "RN8, RN10 hold the MCU outputs\nand both gate outputs LOW while\nU12 is in reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 180.975 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5274ca7f-2360-5e49-b3d7-56e9d3a31a15")
	)
	(text "Y = MOTOR_EN AND permit AND\nMOTOR_FAULT (HIGH = no fault).\nNo firmware in the off path:\nthe host or the fault bus can\nalways remove power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 44.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a867ca62-7478-52af-92b2-1cc659213c99")
	)
	(text "R27 sets the current limit to\n444-568 mA; latch-off, FAULT\npulls MOTOR_FAULT LOW.\nC32 returns through R33 (2.2 Ω)\non sheet 7 (Protected external\nsignals) to damp hot-plug ringing.\nR26 bleeds SERVO_5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "206630ab-c060-53d9-b2b6-4a0ef80c6564")
	)
	(text "PROG (all poles ON): SWD and NRST connect to the host,\nU13 is disabled and D12 clamps both permits.\nRUN (all poles OFF): the host is disconnected.\nRN11: 1 kΩ in series with each host line."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 243.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "36bb468f-23ff-58ab-98a9-4c51253e23a5")
	)
	(text "SET1:SET0 = 1:0: closed window 0.8-1.2 ms,\nframe 102.4-153.6 ms, WDO LOW 22.5-27.5 ms.\nU12 services WDI every 50 ms. WD_EN = PROG_N\n(R37 pull-up): disabled only in PROG."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8e0b9532-baff-5d03-8049-1c531a9cb2ce")
	)
	(text "C33 decouples U11 on sheet 3\n(Motor isolation and current\nlimits). On the board it sits\n3 mm from U11, 5 mm from U13."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.06 255.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5bdac45e-5ccd-5ec2-9bc8-82621af74fd0")
	)
	(text "U16 EN floats (internal pull-up): always on.\nR25 holds SAFE_3V3 near 0 V when U16 is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e02d414d-9c1d-5828-b4fa-e3ba329e9f52")
	)
