		(property "Design_note" "DS13866 TSSOP20. Pin map (routing-driven; the firmware matches it): edge inputs PB6 FAULT, PB7 HEARTBEAT, PC14 RP, PC15 RN, PA0 LN, PA1 LP, PA3 MOTOR_EN (distinct EXTI lines); level inputs PA2 SERVO_REQUEST, PA8 MOTOR_EN_SAFE, PA6 SERVO_POWER_EN; GPIOA outputs PA4 READY (push-pull, not a fault-bus driver), PA5 WDI, PA7 servo permit, PA11 motor permit, PA12 sensor enable. SWD/NRST reserved."
			(at 170.18 139.7 0)
