		(property "Design_note" "PROG_N pull-up: watchdog enabled and permits free unless SW5 pole 4 is ON. 2.2k keeps WD_EN at 3.13 V with Nexperia BAT54C typical reverse leakage at 85 C (2 x ~24 uA) and above VIH 2.26 V up to ~9x typical; costs 1.5 mA only while PROG is ON."
			(at 137.16 228.6 0)
